{{ run_command('psql -c "\\d+ agent_runs"') }}

## RLS Context

All agents use `current_agent_run_id()` to get their run ID:

```sql
SELECT current_agent_run_id();  -- Returns UUID from username
```

RLS policies filter writes by this function.
